{"4581360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Battle For Crown", "steam_appid": 4581360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for Crown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A board that feels alive. Step into a strategic duel where every move carries weight and every decision shapes the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for Crown</strong> is a focused, competitive strategy game where two players face off in a test of timing, awareness, and control. Easy to understand but difficult to master, the game rewards careful planning, adaptation, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the match unfolds, the battlefield evolves. Each captured piece builds your momentum, unlocking powerful magic abilities that can turn the tide in an instant. These abilities trigger cinematic takedowns, transforming quiet moments into intense, high-impact clashes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong> – Every move matters. One mistake can cost you the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-Based Gameplay</strong> – Capture enemy pieces to gain power and unlock abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Combat</strong> – Activate magic skills that trigger dynamic takedown sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive 1v1 Matches</strong> – Face off against another player in a battle of skill and focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Matches</strong> – Games start calm but quickly escalate into fast-paced, tactical showdowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves. Control the board. Claim the crown.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for Crown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A board that feels alive. Step into a strategic duel where every move 